   ],
   "tipo": "texto",
   "texto": "Diámetro del colector de salida [mm]\n100\n150\n200\n250\n300\n350\n400\n450\n500\nL x A [cm]\n40 x 40\n50 x 50\n60 x 60\n60 x 70\n70 x 70\n70 x 80\n80 x 80\n80 x 90\n90 x 90",
